    '**D** — the diffusivity at the process temperature, in square centimetres per second. It is the number that carries all the temperature dependence.': '**D** — the diffusivity at the process temperature, in square centimetres per second. It is the number that carries all the temperature dependence.',
    '**Length scale** — which multiple of the root of D t appears depends on the boundary condition, so all three common ones are printed and labelled.': '**Length scale** — which multiple of the root of D t appears depends on the boundary condition, so all three common ones are printed and labelled.',
    '**Thermal budget** — the product D times t. It has the units of a length squared, not a length, which is why two different time-temperature schedules can share one budget.': '**Thermal budget** — the product D times t. It has the units of a length squared, not a length, which is why two different time-temperature schedules can share one budget.',
